  "description": "Da-on, who was dissatisfied with his position, prepares a Halloween party for his lover Hyun-woo.\n\n\"Reverse potion, werewolf cookie\" Da-on bought some interesting items at a prop shop he happened to enter. After eating werewolf cookies, Da-on got dog ears. Huh? Something changed in Hyun-woo after taking the reverse potion!\n\n(Source: Kidari Studio, translated)\n\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/H_reverse), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/halloween_reverse), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11669428), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=241016), [Peanutoon](https://www.peanutoon.com/ko/comic/detail/12618)",
